  "notes": "Fetched with WebFetch on 2026-10-13. Blocked (robots.txt or fetch error): /search, /login, /order/search, /cart, /deals, product pages and /sitemap.xml; web.archive.org was also blocked for WebFetch. Search, product, cart and sign-in expectations come from the 2026-09-29 browser capture in research/gamestop.md. GameStop has no public HTML site map, so the sitemap list mirrors the header department menu and the main service pages. The real site percent-encodes \"|\" in Xbox Series X|S paths (xbox-series-x%7Cs); the clone uses xbox-series-x-s. Off-site footer links (Narvar returns, MarketForce store feedback, news.gamestop.com investors, careers, app stores) became local summary pages. The real Trade-In link is /trade/; the clone keeps its existing /trade-in route (/trade redirects there). Gift-card menu entries point at filtered listing URLs on the real site and use local /gift-cards/<brand> pages here; Out-Of-Print Cards is a price/franchise-filtered URL on the real site and a local landing page here. The home page Halloween and NY Convention rows are seasonal and were skipped.",
